mastery.question_text:
A ferry's displacement from the harbour is $\underset{\sim}{s}=-7\underset{\sim}{i}+24\underset{\sim}{j}$, measured in kilometres, with $\underset{\sim}{i}$ east and $\underset{\sim}{j}$ north.
Find the true bearing of the ferry from the harbour, to the nearest degree.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=1.1]
\usetikzlibrary{arrows.meta}
\draw[->] (-2,0)--(2,0) node[right]{$E$};
\draw[->] (0,-0.6)--(0,4.3) node[above]{$N$};
\draw[dashed] (-1.05,3.6)--(-1.05,0);
\draw[-{Stealth},thick] (0,0)--(-1.05,3.6) node[above left]{$\underset{\sim}{s}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
